    "text": "This sway control device is marked Pro Series and Made in China. Nowhere on this device or on the box does it say Reese! Some reviews say its the same thing as Reese or the same parent company. Another issue is the rectangular plates are different from the picture. You only get the longer piece with the ball welded to that. Its not an issue for me because I have tools to cut the plate, it just doesn't match the photograph. So, to summarize, the picture shows Reese branding, but its not. The picture also shows two plates, one rectangle and one square. You only get the rectangle piece with the ball attached. So, you don't get what you think you are getting! Buy the Curt, at least you know what you are getting.",
