    "article_index": 9,
    "text": "I got these for my three Chesapeake Bay Retrievers for their Christmas stockings.  I'm glad they each had their own or we would have had some fights on our hands!  They last forever and my dogs are aggressive chewers.  The only thing I noticed with one of the three was it was leaving brownish coloring of some kinds our (beige) carpet.  The other two antlers didn't do that.  As a result, I made sure they next time they got to chew on them, we did it in a room where there's ceramic tile and no carpet.  Not sure what that coloring was but we self corrected it.",
